D21 read as a MASVS-RESILIENCE / obfuscation arc (native secret -> JNI gate -> name obfuscation + decoys -> string\nencryption -> reflection -> dynamic code loading -> anti-debug). Still unnamed in that arc: root, emulator, hook\n(Frida/Xposed) and tamper/repackaging checks, then obfuscation capstones (flattening, VM). After it the untouched MASVS\ngroups are AUTH (biometric/local auth) and the leftover IPC surfaces (bound Service/AIDL, broadcast receivers).\nNext expect also: the payload ENCRYPTED/wrapped\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"New codecs keep arriving (d7 caesar, d15 native, d17 indexed, d19 reflection, d20\ndynamic) and old ones recur (d18 xor)\"\"\",\"\"\"New codecs keep arriving (d7 caesar, d15 native, d17 indexed, d19 reflection, d20\ndynamic) and old ones recur (d18 xor, d21 reverse)\"\"\")\nrep(\"| D21+ likelihood |\",\"| D22+ likelihood |\")\nrep(\"\"\"| 36 | Puzzle codec escalation (compound, zlib, rot47, vigenere, permutation) | partly seen D1-D19 (D17 `indexed`; D18 reused `xor`; D19 `reflection` = plaintext) |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| 36 | Puzzle codec escalation (compound, zlib, rot47, vigenere, permutation) | partly seen D1-D21 (D17 `indexed`; D18 reused `xor`; D19 `reflection` = plaintext; D20 `dynamic` pointer; D21 reused `reverse`) |\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"| 41 | Anti-debug (ptrace, TracerPid) | gap | flag behind the check | `ptrace`, `TracerPid`, `/proc/self/status` | `strings`; static bypass by reading the gated branch | med |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| 41 | Anti-debug (Debug.isDebuggerConnected, TracerPid, ptrace, timing deltas, debuggable flag) | seen D21 (theme only: codec `reverse`; no probe code; TT dex string `debuggerGate`) | value on the CLEAN path of the probe; decoy on the debugged path | `isDebuggerConnected`, `waitingForDebugger`, `TracerPid`, `/proc/self/status`, `SystemClock.elapsedRealtime`/`nanoTime` deltas, `debuggerGate` | `lib.android.clean_device_scan` [i] (probes answer clean); `flattened_cfg_scan` [i] for a state loop; read the gate statically | high (mi