s, `/proc/self/task/*/comm` (`gum-js-loop`, `gmain`), `Modifier.isNative` on own methods, `de.robv.android.xposed` | `jadx`; `hook-framework-introspection-stubs` prebuild | high: next RESILIENCE theme |\n| 92 | Biometric / local authentication bypass (MASVS-AUTH) | gap | `onAuthenticationSucceeded` body (CryptoObject null-tolerant) | `BiometricPrompt$AuthenticationCallback`, `FingerprintManager`, `KeyguardManager.isDeviceSecure`, `setUserAuthenticationRequired` | `jadx`; `biometric-auth-callback-eval` prebuild | med |\n\"\"\"\nanchor=\"\\n## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\"\ni=s.index(anchor)\n# insert rows right after the last table row (row 87)\ns=s[:i].rstrip('\\n')+'\\n'+rows+s[i:]\n# cues block edits (keep line count)\nrep(\"\"\"   su/magisk/RootBeer/goldfish/frida/TracerPid -> flag sits in the gated branch: read it, never run it\"\"\",\n\"\"\"   su/magisk/goldfish/frida/TracerPid/isDebuggerConnected/debuggerGate (D21) -> clean_device_scan: clean-path value\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"   meta-data value= is a hiding spot (huntress.mechanic lives there). droidasc getmanifest x.apk prints the XML.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"   meta-data value= is a hiding spot (huntress.mechanic lives there). debuggable=true (D21) is a fact, not an answer.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"   Proxy/InvocationHandler/MethodHandles/invoke-custom -> resolve the real target; packed-switch in a loop -> flattened CFG\"\"\",\n\"\"\"   Proxy/MethodHandles/invoke-custom -> real target; packed-switch in a loop / $SwitchMap$ -> flattened_cfg_scan\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nawk '/^## Recognition cues/{f=1} /^## Readiness gaps/{f=0} f' reference/coverage/mobile-android.md | wc -l"}}}
